  "notes": "USAGE:\n{潜|もぐ}り{込|こ}む is a compound verb combining {潜|もぐ}る (to dive, to go under) and {込|こ}む (into). The {込|こ}む suffix adds the nuance of going deep inside or fully entering.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {布団|ふとん}に{潜|もぐ}り{込|こ}む (to slip into a futon)\n- ベッドに{潜|もぐ}り{込|こ}む (to crawl into bed)\n- {組織|そしき}に{潜|もぐ}り{込|こ}む (to infiltrate an organization)\n\nGodan verb (mu-row): {潜|もぐ}り{込|こ}まない / {潜|もぐ}り{込|こ}みます / {潜|もぐ}り{込|こ}んで",
